    "value": "$8 billion",
    "unit": "emergency diesel relief for farmers",
    "context": "USDA will pay it as one-time payments to eligible farmers for this harvest. It follows crude's drop on the Trump-Putin diesel deal."
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Grains bounce after losing runs",
      "body": "- Corn took out its report low Monday as funds kept selling, and it is at **$4.67¾** overnight.\n- Soybean inspections were strong Monday, but prices still struggled, and beans are at $12.57½ overnight.\n- Meal slipped 0.5% to $352.90 while soybean oil gained 0.8% to $67.23.",
